\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces One baseline LLM step. \textbf  {Maximum sequential depth: 5} ($3+1+1$, boxed stages are the only LLM calls); common case $1$--$3$. \textbf  {Parallel fan-out: 1} --- no stage issues concurrent calls, so nothing is exempt from the sequential count. Branches are the two gates. There is one retry loop, the enforcement loop inside stage~\textcircled {1}; stage~\textcircled {3} re-enters it with the remaining budget, and its iterations are counted against the same budget in both places.}}{2}{figure.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
